The theme files in this folder (*.json) are the themes of oh-my-pi, which Tern
offers, copied unchanged from @oh-my-pi/pi-tui 18.13.2
(https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi, packages/tui/src/theme: dark.json,
light.json and defaults/*.json). TablePeek converts them at build time
(web/src/themes/omp.ts) into its Tern themes. They are used under the
following license.

